  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia - Healthy snacks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a DGGF Start-up Loan Truluv Holding BV (Truluv) will be able to further automate and scale up the existing production facility for muesli snacks together with the local subsidiary.Truluv produces all-natural granola snacks with ingredients sustainably sourced from local smallholder farmers in Ethiopia. The snacks are made by Ethiopian women. The snack offers a healthy alternative to the unhealthy snacks.The investments required for the plant are not only to expand production capacity, but also to improve overall quality and food hygiene standards. The expected impact is local employment of approximately 32 direct FTE and 45 indirect FTE.</narrative>
  </description>
